What patch 0001 needs to build on M156, found on the Mac: the simulcast factory's
media constants (M156 split rtc_media_base), no HAVE_NO_MEDIA branches (gone in M156),
and the network thread in place of webrtc-sdk's worker thread, which M156 no longer has
apart from it (the audio device module is made and driven on that thread).

diff --git a/sdk/BUILD.gn b/sdk/BUILD.gn
index ebee27f..2439a99 100644
--- a/sdk/BUILD.gn
+++ b/sdk/BUILD.gn
@@ -969,7 +969,7 @@ if (is_ios || is_mac) {
       deps = [
         ":base_objc",
         ":wrapped_native_codec_objc",
-        "../media:rtc_media_base",
+        "../media:media_constants",
         "../media:rtc_simulcast_encoder_adapter",
       ]
     }
